DESCRIPTION:With her quick wit and sharp observations\,  Kelsey Cook  is 
 a stand-up comedian who feels like your best friend. Kelsey can turn her mo
 st embarrassing moments into relatable conversation\, as she tours clubs na
 tionally and connects with her growing audience online. Kelsey’s one-hour
  special “The Hustler” was released on YouTube in 2023 and currently ha
 s 2.6 million views. She's performed on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon 
 multiple times\, as well as This is Not Happening\, EPIX's Unprotected Sets
 \, NBC's A Little Late with Lilly Singh\, and most recently After Midnight 
 on CBS. You can check out Kelsey’s podcast with Chad Daniels\, entitled 
 ‘Pretend Problems’\, and her foosball web-series ‘Wrists of Fury’ w
 hich has over twenty episodes where Kelsey hustles fellow comedians who don
 ’t know she’s a World Champion foosball player.\nMore info: https://com
 edyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/kelsey-cook-63351/
